### 9) GET EMPLOYEES - Filter by name (should return EMPLOYEE #1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?name=Adam&employeeId=emp-003

### 10) GET EMPLOYEES - Filter by name (should return EMPLOYEE #1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?name=Kovacs Adam

### 11) GET EMPLOYEES - Filter by name (should return EMPLOYEE #1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?name=Adam Kovacs

### 12) GET EMPLOYEES - Filter by employeeId (should return EMPLOYEE #2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?employeeId=EMP-002

### 13) GET EMPLOYEES - Filter by employeeId lowercase (should return EMPLOYEE #1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?employeeId=emp-001

